      "id": "claim_90a157be75174e55b5a6dbe8fcc3b087",
      "statement": "prepare_instructions writes openwiki/INSTRUCTIONS.md only when the wiki requested a language and the source does not already ship that file; the brief fixes the page language and the rule of not translating identifiers, paths, commands and API names.",
