      "statement": "env_overrides is the channel used by the header-injecting provider proxy: when extra headers and an OpenAI-compatible base URL are configured, the worker starts a loopback proxy and passes OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL so the CLI reaches the proxy instead of the upstream gateway.",
