      "statement": "Upgrading the CLI needs no service code change while the openwiki --init -p contract holds: the Dockerfile ARG OPENWIKI_VERSION(default 0.6.0) is passed to scripts/install-openwiki.sh, which runs npm install --global openwiki@VERSION and retries once after installing build-essential, and docker-compose.yml propagates the same build arg to api and worker.",
